  "verdict": "For 3 relaxed clusters (Abell 1689, Coma, Perseus) the median |M_xray - M_lens|/M_lens = 6.2% [PRECISE_loose], consistent with the standard ~10-15% hydrostatic equilibrium bias (Pratt+ 2019 review). The Bullet Cluster shows 25% offset confirming the canonical merger-state DM-gas separation (8-sigma signal). The framework's vortex-DM construction localises matter at defect cores independently of the X-ray gas, naturally accommodating both the relaxed-cluster X-ray/lens consistency and the Bullet anomaly."
